# Protect live beats

- Never overwrite Vercel Blob / live `beats` with local `public/site-content.json` defaults.
- `scripts/push-content.mjs` must keep live beats locked; do not push seed `./audio/beat-*.mp3` catalogs.
- Do not run content sync that replaces uploaded (https/blob) beat audio or clears `sold` flags.
- Admin may edit beats; accidental seed resets must be blocked (API `protectBeats` in `api/content.js`).
- Prefer merging or patching non-beat fields only when syncing content.
